#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:19
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"New state of the art 70B model. Llama 3.3 70B offers similar performance "
"compared to the Llama 3.1 405B model."
msgstr ""
"Puntako 70Bko eredu berria. Llama 3.3 70Bk Llama 3.1 405B ereduaren antzeko "
"errendimendua eskaintzen du."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:20
#, kde-format
msgid "QwQ is the reasoning model of the Qwen series."
msgstr "QwQ Qwen saileko arrazoiketa-eredua da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:21
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Llama 3.2 Vision is a collection of instruction-tuned image reasoning "
"generative models in 11B and 90B sizes."
msgstr ""
"Llama 3.2 Vision jarraibideetara doitutako irudi-arrazoiketako eredu "
"sortzaileen bilduma da, 11B eta 90B tamainetan."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:22
#, kde-format
msgid "Meta's Llama 3.2 goes small with 1B and 3B models."
msgstr ""
"Metaren Llama 3.2 ereduak tamaina txikietara jotzen du, 1B eta 3B ereduekin."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:23
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Llama 3.1 is a new state-of-the-art model from Meta available in 8B, 70B and "
"405B parameter sizes."
msgstr ""
"Llama 3.1 Metaren puntako eredu berria da, 8B, 70B eta 405B parametroko "
"tamainetan eskuragarri."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:24
#, kde-format
msgid "Meta Llama 3: The most capable openly available LLM to date"
msgstr ""
"Meta Llama 3: orain arte modu irekian eskuragarri jarritako LLMrik "
"ahaltsuena da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:25
#, kde-format
msgid "The 7B model released by Mistral AI, updated to version 0.3."
msgstr "Mistral AIk argitaratutako 7Bko eredua, 0.3 bertsiora eguneratua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:26
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A high-performing open embedding model with a large token context window."
msgstr ""
"Errendimendu handiko txertatze-eredu irekia, tokenen testuinguru-leiho "
"handia duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:27
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Gemma is a family of lightweight, state-of-the-art open models built by "
"Google DeepMind. Updated to version 1.1"
msgstr ""
"Gemma Google DeepMindek eraikitako puntako eredu ireki arinen familia da. "
"1.1 bertsiora eguneratua"

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:28
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Qwen 1.5 is a series of large language models by Alibaba Cloud spanning from "
"0.5B to 110B parameters"
msgstr ""
"Qwen 1.5 Alibaba Clouden hizkuntza-eredu handien saila da, 0,5Btik 110B "
"parametrora bitartekoa"

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:29
#, kde-format
msgid "Qwen2 is a new series of large language models from Alibaba group"
msgstr "Qwen2 Alibaba taldearen hizkuntza-eredu handien sail berria da"

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:30
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Phi-3 is a family of lightweight 3B (Mini) and 14B (Medium) state-of-the-art "
"open models by Microsoft."
msgstr ""
"Phi-3 Microsoften puntako eredu ireki arinen familia da, 3B (Mini) eta 14B "
"(Medium) tamainetan."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:31
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Llama 2 is a collection of foundation language models ranging from 7B to 70B "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Llama 2 oinarrizko hizkuntza-ereduen bilduma da, 7Btik 70B parametro "
"bitartekoa."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:33
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Qwen2.5 models are pretrained on Alibaba's latest large-scale dataset, "
"encompassing up to 18 trillion tokens. The model supports up to 128K tokens "
"and has multilingual support."
msgstr ""
"Qwen2.5 ereduak Alibabaren eskala handiko azken datu-multzoarekin aurretik "
"trebatu dira; multzoak 18 bilioi token arte ditu. Ereduak 128K token arte "
"onartzen ditu, eta hizkuntza anitzeko euskarria du."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:35
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Google Gemma 2 is a high-performing and efficient model available in three "
"sizes: 2B, 9B, and 27B."
msgstr ""
"Google Gemma 2 errendimendu handiko eredu eraginkorra da, hiru tamainatan "
"eskuragarri: 2B, 9B eta 27B."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:37
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"LLaVA is a novel end-to-end trained large multimodal model that combines a "
"vision encoder and Vicuna for general-purpose visual and language "
"understanding. Updated to version 1.6."
msgstr ""
"LLaVA muturretik muturrera trebatutako eredu multimodal handi berritzailea "
"da; ikusmen-kodetzaile bat eta Vicuna bateratzen ditu, helburu orokorreko "
"ikusmen- eta hizkuntza-ulermenerako. 1.6 bertsiora eguneratua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:39
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A large language model that can use text prompts to generate and discuss "
"code."
msgstr ""
"Kodea sortzeko eta kodeari buruz jarduteko testu-eskaerak erabil ditzakeen "
"hizkuntza-eredu handia."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:41
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The latest series of Code-Specific Qwen models, with significant "
"improvements in code generation, code reasoning, and code fixing."
msgstr ""
"Berariaz koderako Qwen ereduen azken saila, kode-sorkuntzan, kode-"
"arrazoiketan eta kode-konponketan hobekuntza nabarmenak dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:42
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art 12B model with 128k context length, built by Mistral AI "
"in collaboration with NVIDIA."
msgstr ""
"Mistral AIk NVIDIArekin elkarlanean eraikitako puntako 12Bko eredua, 128K-ko "
"testuinguru-luzera duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:43
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The TinyLlama project is an open endeavor to train a compact 1.1B Llama "
"model on 3 trillion tokens."
msgstr ""
"TinyLlama proiektua 1,1Bko Llama eredu trinkoa 3 bilioi tokenekin trebatzeko "
"ekimen irekia da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:44
#, kde-format
msgid "State-of-the-art large embedding model from mixedbread.ai"
msgstr "«mixedbread.ai»ren puntako txertatze-eredu handia."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:46
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"StarCoder2 is the next generation of transparently trained open code LLMs "
"that comes in three sizes: 3B, 7B and 15B parameters."
msgstr ""
"StarCoder2 modu gardenean trebatutako kode irekiko LLMen hurrengo "
"belaunaldia da, hiru tamainatan eskuragarri: 3B, 7B eta 15B parametro."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:47
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A set of Mixture of Experts (MoE) model with open weights by Mistral AI in "
"8x7b and 8x22b parameter sizes."
msgstr ""
"Mistral AIren pisu irekiko adituen nahasketa-ereduen (MoE) multzoa, 8×7B eta "
"8×22B tamainetan."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:49
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Uncensored, 8x7b and 8x22b fine-tuned models based on the Mixtral mixture of "
"experts models that excels at coding tasks. Created by Eric Hartford."
msgstr ""
"Zentsurarik gabeko 8×7B eta 8×22B tamainako eredu doituak, kodegintza-"
"lanetan bikainak diren Mixtral adituen nahasketa-ereduetan oinarrituak. Eric "
"Hartfordek sortuak."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:52
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"CodeGemma is a collection of powerful, lightweight models that can perform a "
"variety of coding tasks like fill-in-the-middle code completion, code "
"generation, natural language understanding, mathematical reasoning, and "
"instruction following."
msgstr ""
"CodeGemma eredu ahaltsu eta arinen bilduma bat da; hainbat kodegintza-lan "
"egin ditzake, hala nola erdiko hutsunea betetzeko kode-osaketa, kode-"
"sorkuntza, hizkuntza naturalaren ulermena, arrazoiketa matematikoa eta "
"jarraibideei jarraitzea."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:55
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"An open-source Mixture-of-Experts code language model that achieves "
"performance comparable to GPT4-Turbo in code-specific tasks."
msgstr ""
"Sorburu irekiko adituen nahasketa motako (MoE) koderako hizkuntza-eredua, "
"kodeari berariazko atazetan GPT-4 Turboren pareko errendimendua lortzen "
"duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:56
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Phi-2: a 2.7B language model by Microsoft Research that demonstrates "
"outstanding reasoning and language understanding capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Phi-2: Microsoft Researchen 2,7Bko hizkuntza-eredua, arrazoiketa- eta "
"hizkuntza-ulermeneko gaitasun bikainak erakusten dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:57
#, kde-format
msgid "Uncensored Llama 2 model by George Sung and Jarrad Hope."
msgstr ""
"George Sungek eta Jarrad Hopek sortutako Llama 2 zentsurarik gabeko eredua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:58
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"DeepSeek Coder is a capable coding model trained on two trillion code and "
"natural language tokens."
msgstr ""
"DeepSeek Coder bi bilioi kode- eta hizkuntza naturaleko tokenekin "
"trebatutako kodegintza-eredu trebea da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:59
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A suite of text embedding models by Snowflake, optimized for performance."
msgstr ""
"Snowflakeren testu-txertatze ereduen multzoa, errendimendurako optimizatua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:61
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"State of the art large language model from Microsoft AI with improved "
"performance on complex chat, multilingual, reasoning and agent use cases."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft AIren puntako hizkuntza-eredu handia, berriketa konplexuetan, "
"hizkuntza anitzeko erabileran, arrazoiketan eta agenteen erabilera-kasuetan "
"errendimendu hobetua duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:63
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The uncensored Dolphin model based on Mistral that excels at coding tasks. "
"Updated to version 2.8."
msgstr ""
"Mistralen oinarritutako Dolphin eredu zentsuratu gabea, kodegintza-atazetan "
"bikain aritzen dena. 2.8 bertsiora eguneratua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:65
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Dolphin 2.9 is a new model with 8B and 70B sizes by Eric Hartford based on "
"Llama 3 that has a variety of instruction, conversational, and coding skills."
msgstr ""
"Dolphin 2.9 Eric Hartfordek Llama 3n oinarrituta egindako 8B eta 70B "
"tamainetako eredu berria da, jarraibideak betetzeko, elkarrizketarako eta "
"kodegintzarako hainbat gaitasun dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:67
#, kde-format
msgid "Yi 1.5 is a high-performing, bilingual language model."
msgstr "Yi 1.5 errendimendu handiko hizkuntza-eredu elebiduna da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:68
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Command R is a Large Language Model optimized for conversational interaction "
"and long context tasks."
msgstr ""
"Command R elkarrizketa bidezko elkarreraginerako eta testuinguru luzeko "
"atazetarako optimizatutako hizkuntza-eredu handia da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:69
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A general-purpose model ranging from 3 billion parameters to 70 billion, "
"suitable for entry-level hardware."
msgstr ""
"3 mila milioi eta 70 mila milioi parametro bitarteko erabilera orokorreko "
"eredua, oinarrizko hardwarerako egokia."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:70
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A LLaVA model fine-tuned from Llama 3 Instruct with better scores in several "
"benchmarks."
msgstr ""
"Llama 3 Instructetik doitutako LLaVA eredua, hainbat erreferentzia-probatan "
"puntuazio hobeak dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:71
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Zephyr is a series of fine-tuned versions of the Mistral and Mixtral models "
"that are trained to act as helpful assistants."
msgstr ""
"Zephyr Mistral eta Mixtral ereduen bertsio doituen saila da, laguntzaile "
"erabilgarri gisa jarduteko trebatua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:72
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A lightweight AI model with 3.8 billion parameters with performance "
"overtaking similarly and larger sized models."
msgstr ""
"3,8 mila milioi parametroko AA eredu arina, tamaina bereko eta handiagoko "
"ereduen errendimendua gainditzen duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:73
#, kde-format
msgid "Embedding models on very large sentence level datasets."
msgstr ""
"Esaldi-mailako datu-multzo oso handiekin trebatutako txertatze-ereduak."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:74
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Codestral is Mistral AI’s first-ever code model designed for code generation "
"tasks."
msgstr ""
"Codestral Mistral AIren lehen kode-eredua da, kode-sorkuntzako atazetarako "
"diseinatua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:75
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"StarCoder is a code generation model trained on 80+ programming languages."
msgstr ""
"StarCoder 80 programazio-lengoaia baino gehiagorekin trebatutako kode-"
"sorkuntzako eredua da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:76
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"General use chat model based on Llama and Llama 2 with 2K to 16K context "
"sizes."
msgstr ""
"Llaman eta Llama 2n oinarritutako erabilera orokorreko berriketa-eredua, 2K "
"eta 16K bitarteko testuinguru-tamainekin."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:77
#, kde-format
msgid "A family of open foundation models by IBM for Code Intelligence"
msgstr "Kode-adimenerako IBMren oinarri irekiko ereduen familia."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:78
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Mistral OpenOrca is a 7 billion parameter model, fine-tuned on top of the "
"Mistral 7B model using the OpenOrca dataset."
msgstr ""
"Mistral OpenOrca 7 mila milioi parametroko eredua da, OpenOrca datu-multzoa "
"erabiliz Mistral 7B ereduaren gainean doitua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:79
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A family of small models with 135M, 360M, and 1.7B parameters, trained on a "
"new high-quality dataset."
msgstr ""
"135M, 360M eta 1,7B parametroko eredu txikien familia, kalitate handiko datu-"
"multzo berri batekin trebatua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:80
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Wizard Vicuna Uncensored is a 7B, 13B, and 30B parameter model based on "
"Llama 2 uncensored by Eric Hartford."
msgstr ""
"Wizard Vicuna Uncensored 7B, 13B eta 30B parametroko eredua da, Eric "
"Hartforden zentsurarik gabeko Llama 2 ereduan oinarritua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:81
#, kde-format
msgid "Llama 2 based model fine tuned to improve Chinese dialogue ability."
msgstr ""
"Txineraz elkarrizketatzeko gaitasuna hobetzeko doitutako Llama 2n "
"oinarritutako eredua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:83
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"BGE-M3 is a new model from BAAI distinguished for its versatility in Multi-"
"Functionality, Multi-Linguality, and Multi-Granularity."
msgstr ""
"BGE-M3 BAAIren eredu berria da, funtzio-, hizkuntza- eta xehetasun-maila "
"anitzeko moldakortasunagatik nabarmentzen dena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:84
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A versatile model for AI software development scenarios, including code "
"completion."
msgstr ""
"AA softwarea garatzeko agertokietarako eredu moldakorra, kodea osatzea barne."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:86
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A family of open-source models trained on a wide variety of data, surpassing "
"ChatGPT on various benchmarks. Updated to version 3.5-0106."
msgstr ""
"Askotariko datuekin trebatutako sorburu irekiko ereduen familia, hainbat "
"erreferentzia-probatan ChatGPT gainditzen duena. 3.5-0106 bertsiora "
"eguneratua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:87
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Aya 23, released by Cohere, is a new family of state-of-the-art, "
"multilingual models that support 23 languages."
msgstr ""
"Coherek argitaratutako Aya 23 puntako eredu eleaniztunen familia berria da, "
"23 hizkuntza onartzen dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:88
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"CodeQwen1.5 is a large language model pretrained on a large amount of code "
"data."
msgstr ""
"CodeQwen1.5 kode-datu kopuru handiarekin aurretik trebatutako hizkuntza-"
"eredu handia da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:89
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The powerful family of models by Nous Research that excels at scientific "
"discussion and coding tasks."
msgstr ""
"Nous Researchen eredu-familia ahaltsua, eztabaida zientifikoetan eta "
"kodegintza-atazetan bikain aritzen dena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:90
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Command R+ is a powerful, scalable large language model purpose-built to "
"excel at real-world enterprise use cases."
msgstr ""
"Command R+ hizkuntza-eredu handi ahaltsu eta eskalagarria da, enpresen mundu "
"errealeko erabilera-kasuetan bikain aritzeko berariaz eraikia."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:91
#, kde-format
msgid "State-of-the-art code generation model"
msgstr "Puntako kode-sorkuntzako eredua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:93
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Stable Code 3B is a coding model with instruct and code completion variants "
"on par with models such as Code Llama 7B that are 2.5x larger."
msgstr ""
"Stable Code 3B kode-ereduak jarraibideetarako eta kodea osatzeko aldaerak "
"ditu, eta 2,5 aldiz handiagoak diren Code Llama 7B gisako ereduen parekoa da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:94
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"An experimental 1.1B parameter model trained on the new Dolphin 2.8 dataset "
"by Eric Hartford and based on TinyLlama."
msgstr ""
"Eric Hartfordek Dolphin 2.8 datu-multzo berriarekin trebatutako eta "
"TinyLlaman oinarritutako 1,1B parametroko eredu esperimentala."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:95
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"OpenHermes 2.5 is a 7B model fine-tuned by Teknium on Mistral with fully "
"open datasets."
msgstr ""
"OpenHermes 2.5 Tekniumek datu-multzo guztiz irekiak erabiliz Mistralen "
"gainean doitutako 7Bko eredu bat da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:97
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Mistral Large 2 is Mistral's new flagship model that is significantly more "
"capable in code generation, mathematics, and reasoning with 128k context "
"window and support for dozens of languages."
msgstr ""
"Mistral Large 2 Mistralen eredu enblematiko berria da; kode-sorkuntzan, "
"matematikan eta arrazoiketan askoz gaitasun handiagoa du, 128K-ko "
"testuinguru-leihoa eta dozenaka hizkuntzatarako euskarria."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:100
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Qwen2 Math is a series of specialized math language models built upon the "
"Qwen2 LLMs, which significantly outperforms the mathematical capabilities of "
"open-source models and even closed-source models (e.g., GPT4o)."
msgstr ""
"Qwen2 Math Qwen2 LLMen gainean eraikitako matematikako hizkuntza-eredu "
"espezializatuen sail bat da, eta sorburu irekiko nahiz sorburu itxiko "
"ereduen (adibidez, GPT-4o) matematika-gaitasunak nabarmen gainditzen ditu."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:102
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A strong multi-lingual general language model with competitive performance "
"to Llama 3."
msgstr ""
"Hizkuntza anitzeko erabilera orokorreko eredu sendoa, Llama 3ren pareko "
"errendimendua duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:104
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Stable LM 2 is a state-of-the-art 1.6B and 12B parameter language model "
"trained on multilingual data in English, Spanish, German, Italian, French, "
"Portuguese, and Dutch."
msgstr ""
"Stable LM 2 puntako teknologiako 1,6B eta 12B parametroko hizkuntza-eredua "
"da, ingelesezko, gaztelaniazko, alemanezko, italierazko, frantsesezko, "
"portugesezko eta nederlanderazko datu eleaniztunekin trebatua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:106
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"BakLLaVA is a multimodal model consisting of the Mistral 7B base model "
"augmented with the LLaVA architecture."
msgstr ""
"BakLLaVA eredu multimodal bat da, LLaVA arkitekturarekin hedatutako Mistral "
"7B oinarrizko ereduak osatua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:108
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A high-performing model trained with a new technique called Reflection-"
"tuning that teaches a LLM to detect mistakes in its reasoning and correct "
"course."
msgstr ""
"Reflection-tuning izeneko teknika berri batekin trebatutako errendimendu "
"handiko eredua; teknika horrek LLMari bere arrazoiketako akatsak hautematen "
"eta norabidea zuzentzen irakasten dio."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:110
#, kde-format
msgid "An advanced language model crafted with 2 trillion bilingual tokens."
msgstr "Bi bilioi token elebidunekin sortutako hizkuntza-eredu aurreratua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:111
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This model extends LLama-3 8B's context length from 8k to over 1m tokens."
msgstr ""
"Eredu honek Llama 3 8Bren testuinguru-luzera 8K tokenetik milioi bat token "
"baino gehiagora hedatzen du."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:112
#, kde-format
msgid "Model focused on math and logic problems"
msgstr "Matematika- eta logika-problemetan ardaztutako eredua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:113
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"moondream2 is a small vision language model designed to run efficiently on "
"edge devices."
msgstr ""
"moondream2 gailu periferikoetan eraginkortasunez exekutatzeko diseinatutako "
"ikusmen- eta hizkuntza-eredu txiki bat da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:114
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A fine-tuned model based on Mistral with good coverage of domain and "
"language."
msgstr ""
"Mistralen oinarritutako eredu doitua, arlo eta hizkuntza ugari hartzen "
"dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:116
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A model from NVIDIA based on Llama 3 that excels at conversational question "
"answering (QA) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG)."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIAren eredu bat, Llama 3n oinarritua, elkarrizketa bidezko galdera-"
"erantzunetan (QA) eta berreskuratze bidez aberastutako sorkuntzan (RAG) "
"bikain aritzen dena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:117
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Conversational model based on Llama 2 that performs competitively on various "
"benchmarks."
msgstr ""
"Llama 2n oinarritutako elkarrizketa-eredua, hainbat erreferentzia-probatan "
"errendimendu lehiakorra duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:118
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"SQLCoder is a code completion model fined-tuned on StarCoder for SQL "
"generation tasks"
msgstr ""
"SQLCoder StarCoderren gainean SQLa sortzeko atazetarako doitutako kodea "
"osatzeko eredua da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:119
#, kde-format
msgid "General use models based on Llama and Llama 2 from Nous Research."
msgstr ""
"Nous Researchen erabilera orokorreko ereduak, Llaman eta Llama 2n "
"oinarrituak."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:120
#, kde-format
msgid "Code generation model based on Code Llama."
msgstr "Code Llaman oinarritutako kode-sorkuntzako eredua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:121
#, kde-format
msgid "An extension of Llama 2 that supports a context of up to 128k tokens."
msgstr "Llama 2ren hedapen bat, 128K token arteko testuingurua onartzen duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:122
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A 7B and 15B uncensored variant of the Dolphin model family that excels at "
"coding, based on StarCoder2."
msgstr ""
"StarCoder2n oinarritutako Dolphin eredu-familiaren 7B eta 15Bko zentsurarik "
"gabeko aldaera, kodegintzan bikain aritzen dena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:123
#, kde-format
msgid "General use model based on Llama 2."
msgstr "Llama 2n oinarritutako erabilera orokorreko eredua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:124
#, kde-format
msgid "A strong, economical, and efficient Mixture-of-Experts language model."
msgstr "Adituen nahasketako hizkuntza-eredu sendo, ekonomiko eta eraginkorra."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:126
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Starling is a large language model trained by reinforcement learning from AI "
"feedback focused on improving chatbot helpfulness."
msgstr ""
"Starling AAren atzeraelikaduratik abiatutako indartze-ikaskuntzaren bidez "
"trebatutako hizkuntza-eredu handi bat da, berriketa-boten erabilgarritasuna "
"hobetzera bideratua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:127
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A companion assistant trained in philosophy, psychology, and personal "
"relationships. Based on Mistral."
msgstr ""
"Filosofian, psikologian eta harreman pertsonaletan trebatutako laguntzaile "
"pertsonala. Mistralen oinarritua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:128
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Hermes 3 is the latest version of the flagship Hermes series of LLMs by Nous "
"Research"
msgstr ""
"Hermes 3 Nous Researchen Hermes LLM sail enblematikoaren azken bertsioa da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:130
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Yi-Coder is a series of open-source code language models that delivers state-"
"of-the-art coding performance with fewer than 10 billion parameters."
msgstr ""
"Yi-Coder sorburu irekiko kode-hizkuntzako ereduen sail bat da, 10 mila "
"milioi parametro baino gutxiagorekin puntako kodegintza-errendimendua "
"eskaintzen duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:133
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A large language model built by the Technology Innovation Institute (TII) "
"for use in summarization, text generation, and chat bots."
msgstr ""
"Technology Innovation Institutek (TII) laburpenak egiteko, testua sortzeko "
"eta berriketa-botetan erabiltzeko eraikitako hizkuntza-eredu handia."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:134
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"InternLM2.5 is a 7B parameter model tailored for practical scenarios with "
"outstanding reasoning capability."
msgstr ""
"InternLM2.5 7B parametroko eredu bat da, egoera praktikoetarako egokitua eta "
"arrazoiketa-gaitasun bikaina duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:135
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A compact, yet powerful 10.7B large language model designed for single-turn "
"conversation."
msgstr ""
"Txanda bakarreko elkarrizketetarako diseinatutako 10,7Bko hizkuntza-eredu "
"handi trinko baina ahaltsua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:136
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Athene-V2 is a 72B parameter model which excels at code completion, "
"mathematics, and log extraction tasks."
msgstr ""
"Athene-V2 72B parametroko eredua da, kodea osatzen, matematikan eta "
"egunkarietako datuak erauzten bikain aritzen dena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:137
#, kde-format
msgid "A new small LLaVA model fine-tuned from Phi 3 Mini."
msgstr "Phi 3 Minitik doitutako LLaVA eredu txiki berria."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:139
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Orca 2 is built by Microsoft research, and are a fine-tuned version of "
"Meta's Llama 2 models. The model is designed to excel particularly in "
"reasoning."
msgstr ""
"Orca 2 Microsoft Researchek eraiki du, eta Metaren Llama 2 ereduen bertsio "
"doitua da. Arrazoiketan bereziki bikain aritzeko diseinatuta dago."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:141
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A series of multimodal LLMs (MLLMs) designed for vision-language "
"understanding."
msgstr ""
"Ikusmenaren eta hizkuntzaren ulermenerako diseinatutako LLM multimodalen "
"(MLLM) sail bat."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:142
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Llama 2 based model fine tuned on an Orca-style dataset. Originally called "
"Free Willy."
msgstr ""
"Orca estiloko datu-multzo batekin doitutako Llama 2n oinarritutako eredua. "
"Hasieran Free Willy izenekoa."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:143
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Mistral Small 3 sets a new benchmark in the “small” Large Language Models "
"category below 70B."
msgstr ""
"Mistral Small 3k erreferentzia berri bat ezartzen du 70Btik beherako "
"hizkuntza-eredu handi «txikien» kategorian."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:144
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"2.7B uncensored Dolphin model by Eric Hartford, based on the Phi language "
"model by Microsoft Research."
msgstr ""
"Eric Hartforden 2,7Bko Dolphin zentsurarik gabeko eredua, Microsoft "
"Researchen Phi hizkuntza-ereduan oinarritua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:145
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"SmolLM2 is a family of compact language models available in three size: "
"135M, 360M, and 1.7B parameters."
msgstr ""
"SmolLM2 hiru tamainatan eskuragarri dagoen hizkuntza-eredu trinkoen familia "
"da: 135M, 360M eta 1,7B parametro."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:146
#, kde-format
msgid "Uncensored version of Wizard LM model"
msgstr "Wizard LM ereduaren zentsurarik gabeko bertsioa."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:147
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A commercial-friendly small language model by NVIDIA optimized for roleplay, "
"RAG QA, and function calling."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIAren hizkuntza-eredu txiki bat, merkataritza-erabilerarako egokia eta "
"rol-jokoetarako, RAG bidezko galdera-erantzunetarako eta funtzio-deietarako "
"optimizatua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:148
#, kde-format
msgid "An extension of Mistral to support context windows of 64K or 128K."
msgstr "Mistralen hedapen bat, 64K edo 128K-ko testuinguru-leihoak onartzeko."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:150
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"An expansion of Llama 2 that specializes in integrating both general "
"language understanding and domain-specific knowledge, particularly in "
"programming and mathematics."
msgstr ""
"Llama 2ren hedapen bat, hizkuntzaren ulermen orokorra eta arlo jakinetako "
"ezagutza —bereziki programaziokoa eta matematikakoa— bateratzen "
"espezializatua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:152
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Fine-tuned Llama 2 model to answer medical questions based on an open source "
"medical dataset."
msgstr ""
"Medikuntzako datu-multzo ireki batean oinarrituta galdera medikoei "
"erantzuteko doitutako Llama 2 eredua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:153
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Open-source medical large language model adapted from Llama 2 to the medical "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"Llama 2tik medikuntzaren arlora egokitutako sorburu irekiko hizkuntza-eredu "
"handia."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:155
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A series of models from Groq that represent a significant advancement in "
"open-source AI capabilities for tool use/function calling."
msgstr ""
"Groqen eredu-sail bat, tresnen erabilerarako eta funtzio-deietarako sorburu "
"irekiko AAren gaitasunetan aurrerapen nabarmena dakarrena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:157
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Llama-3.1-Nemotron-70B-Instruct is a large language model customized by "
"NVIDIA to improve the helpfulness of LLM generated responses to user queries."
msgstr ""
"Llama-3.1-Nemotron-70B-Instruct NVIDIAk pertsonalizatutako hizkuntza-eredu "
"handi bat da, erabiltzaileen kontsultei LLMek sortutako erantzunen "
"erabilgarritasuna hobetzeko."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:159
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Nexus Raven is a 13B instruction tuned model for function calling tasks."
msgstr ""
"Nexus Raven funtzio-deien atazetarako jarraibideetara doitutako 13Bko eredua "
"da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:160
#, kde-format
msgid "The Nous Hermes 2 model from Nous Research, now trained over Mixtral."
msgstr ""
"Nous Researchen Nous Hermes 2 eredua, orain Mixtralen gainean trebatua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:161
#, kde-format
msgid "Great code generation model based on Llama2."
msgstr "Llama 2n oinarritutako kode-sorkuntzako eredu bikaina."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:162
#, kde-format
msgid "Uncensored Llama2 based model with support for a 16K context window."
msgstr ""
"Llama 2n oinarritutako zentsurarik gabeko eredua, 16K-ko testuinguru-leihoa "
"onartzen duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:164
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The IBM Granite 2B and 8B models are designed to support tool-based use "
"cases and support for retrieval augmented generation (RAG), streamlining "
"code generation, translation and bug fixing."
msgstr ""
"IBM Granite 2B eta 8B ereduak tresnetan oinarritutako erabilera-kasuak eta "
"berreskuratze bidez aberastutako sorkuntza (RAG) onartzeko diseinatuta "
"daude, kode-sorkuntza, itzulpena eta akatsen konponketa arinduz."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:167
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Magicoder is a family of 7B parameter models trained on 75K synthetic "
"instruction data using OSS-Instruct, a novel approach to enlightening LLMs "
"with open-source code snippets."
msgstr ""
"Magicoder 7B parametroko ereduen familia da, OSS-Instruct erabiliz 75K "
"jarraibide-datu sintetikorekin trebatua; LLMak sorburu irekiko kode-zatiekin "
"gaitzeko ikuspegi berria da OSS-Instruct."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:169
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A lightweight chat model allowing accurate, and responsive output without "
"requiring high-end hardware."
msgstr ""
"Berriketa-eredu arina, goi-mailako hardwarerik behar izan gabe emaitza "
"zehatzak eta erantzun arinak ematen dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:170
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A high-performing code instruct model created by merging two existing code "
"models."
msgstr ""
"Lehendik zeuden bi kode-eredu bateratuz sortutako errendimendu handiko "
"jarraibideetarako kode-eredua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:171
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Falcon2 is an 11B parameters causal decoder-only model built by TII and "
"trained over 5T tokens."
msgstr ""
"Falcon2 TIIk eraikitako 11B parametroko deskodetzaile kausal hutseko eredua "
"da, 5 bilioi token baino gehiagorekin trebatua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:172
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Wizard Vicuna is a 13B parameter model based on Llama 2 trained by "
"MelodysDreamj."
msgstr ""
"Wizard Vicuna Llama 2n oinarritutako 13B parametroko eredua da, "
"MelodysDreamjek trebatua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:173
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"MistralLite is a fine-tuned model based on Mistral with enhanced "
"capabilities of processing long contexts."
msgstr ""
"MistralLite Mistralen oinarritutako eredu doitua da, testuinguru luzeak "
"prozesatzeko gaitasun hobetua duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:174
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"MathΣtral: a 7B model designed for math reasoning and scientific discovery "
"by Mistral AI."
msgstr ""
"MathΣtral: Mistral AIk matematika-arrazoiketarako eta aurkikuntza "
"zientifikorako diseinatutako 7Bko eredua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:175
#, kde-format
msgid "7B parameter text-to-SQL model made by MotherDuck and Numbers Station."
msgstr ""
"MotherDuckek eta Numbers Stationek egindako testutik SQLrako 7B parametroko "
"eredua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:176
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"MegaDolphin-2.2-120b is a transformation of Dolphin-2.2-70b created by "
"interleaving the model with itself."
msgstr ""
"MegaDolphin-2.2-120B Dolphin-2.2-70B bere buruarekin tartekatuz sortutako "
"eraldaketa bat da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:177
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Solar Pro Preview: an advanced large language model (LLM) with 22 billion "
"parameters designed to fit into a single GPU"
msgstr ""
"Solar Pro Preview: GPU bakarrean sartzeko diseinatutako 22 mila milioi "
"parametroko hizkuntza-eredu handi (LLM) aurreratua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:178
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A series of models that convert HTML content to Markdown content, which is "
"useful for content conversion tasks."
msgstr ""
"HTML edukia Markdown eduki bihurtzen duten ereduen saila, edukia bihurtzeko "
"atazetarako erabilgarria."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:179
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A top-performing mixture of experts model, fine-tuned with high-quality data."
msgstr ""
"Adituen nahasketako errendimendu handieneko eredua, kalitate handiko "
"datuekin doitua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:180
#, kde-format
msgid "A 7B chat model fine-tuned with high-quality data and based on Zephyr."
msgstr ""
"Kalitate handiko datuekin doitutako eta Zephyrren oinarritutako 7Bko "
"berriketa-eredua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:181
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Merge of the Open Orca OpenChat model and the Garage-bAInd Platypus 2 model. "
"Designed for chat and code generation."
msgstr ""
"Open Orca OpenChat ereduaren eta Garage-bAInd Platypus 2 ereduaren "
"bateratzea. Berriketarako eta kode-sorkuntzarako diseinatua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:182
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A language model created by combining two fine-tuned Llama 2 70B models into "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Doitutako Llama 2 70Bko bi eredu bakarrean konbinatuz sortutako hizkuntza-"
"eredua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:184
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The IBM Granite 1B and 3B models are the first mixture of experts (MoE) "
"Granite models from IBM designed for low latency usage."
msgstr ""
"IBM Granite 1B eta 3B ereduak IBMren adituen nahasketako (MoE) lehen Granite "
"ereduak dira, latentzia txikiko erabilerarako diseinatuak."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:185
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A 3.8B model fine-tuned on a private high-quality synthetic dataset for "
"information extraction, based on Phi-3."
msgstr ""
"Phi-3n oinarritutako 3,8Bko eredua, informazioa erauzteko kalitate handiko "
"datu-multzo sintetiko pribatu batekin doitua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:186
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Cohere For AI's language models trained to perform well across 23 different "
"languages."
msgstr ""
"Cohere For AIren hizkuntza-ereduak, 23 hizkuntzatan ondo aritzeko trebatuak."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:187
#, kde-format
msgid "DBRX is an open, general-purpose LLM created by Databricks."
msgstr "DBRX Databricksek sortutako erabilera orokorreko LLM ireki bat da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:188
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"An open large reasoning model for real-world solutions by the Alibaba "
"International Digital Commerce Group (AIDC-AI)."
msgstr ""
"Alibaba International Digital Commerce Groupek (AIDC-AI) mundu errealeko "
"konponbideetarako egindako arrazoiketa-eredu handi irekia."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:189
#, kde-format
msgid "Embedding model from BAAI mapping texts to vectors."
msgstr "BAAIren txertatze-eredua, testuak bektore bihurtzen dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:190
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"An open weights function calling model based on Llama 3, competitive with "
"GPT-4o function calling capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Llama 3n oinarritutako pisu irekiko funtzio-deien eredua, GPT-4oren funtzio-"
"deietarako gaitasunen parekoa."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:191
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A robust conversational model designed to be used for both chat and instruct "
"use cases."
msgstr ""
"Berriketako nahiz jarraibideetako erabilera-kasuetarako diseinatutako "
"elkarrizketa-eredu sendoa."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:193
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"An upgraded version of DeekSeek-V2 that integrates the general and coding "
"abilities of both DeepSeek-V2-Chat and DeepSeek-Coder-V2-Instruct."
msgstr ""
"DeepSeek-V2ren bertsio berritua, DeepSeek-V2-Chat eta DeepSeek-Coder-V2-"
"Instruct ereduen gaitasun orokorrak eta kodegintzakoak bateratzen dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:195
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"ShieldGemma is set of instruction tuned models for evaluating the safety of "
"text prompt input and text output responses against a set of defined safety "
"policies."
msgstr ""
"ShieldGemma testu-eskaeren sarrerak eta testuzko erantzunak zehaztutako "
"segurtasun-politiken arabera ebaluatzeko jarraibideetara doitutako ereduen "
"multzoa da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:197
#, kde-format
msgid "A state-of-the-art fact-checking model developed by Bespoke Labs."
msgstr ""
"Bespoke Labsek garatutako puntako teknologiako egitateak egiaztatzeko eredua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:198
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Llama Guard 3 is a series of models fine-tuned for content safety "
"classification of LLM inputs and responses."
msgstr ""
"Llama Guard 3 LLMen sarreren eta erantzunen eduki-segurtasuna sailkatzeko "
"doitutako ereduen saila da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:199
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Sentence-transformers model that can be used for tasks like clustering or "
"semantic search."
msgstr ""
"Multzokatzea edo bilaketa semantikoa bezalako atazetarako erabil daitekeen "
"sentence-transformers eredua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:201
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"OpenCoder is an open and reproducible code LLM family which includes 1.5B "
"and 8B models, supporting chat in English and Chinese languages."
msgstr ""
"OpenCoder kode-LLMen familia ireki eta erreproduzigarria da; 1,5B eta 8B "
"ereduak ditu, eta ingelesezko eta txinerazko berriketa onartzen du."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:203
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Tülu 3 is a leading instruction following model family, offering fully open-"
"source data, code, and recipes by the The Allen Institute for AI."
msgstr ""
"Tülu 3 jarraibideak betetzeko ereduen familia aitzindaria da; The Allen "
"Institute for AIk sorburu guztiz irekiko datuak, kodea eta errezetak "
"eskaintzen ditu."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:205
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Snowflake's frontier embedding model. Arctic Embed 2.0 adds multilingual "
"support without sacrificing English performance or scalability."
msgstr ""
"Snowflakeren puntako txertatze-eredua. Arctic Embed 2.0k hizkuntza anitzeko "
"euskarria gehitzen du ingelesezko errendimenduari edo eskalagarritasunari "
"uko egin gabe."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:206
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The IBM Granite Guardian 3.0 2B and 8B models are designed to detect risks "
"in prompts and/or responses."
msgstr ""
"IBM Granite Guardian 3.0ren 2B eta 8B ereduak eskaeretan eta/edo "
"erantzunetan arriskuak hautemateko diseinatuta daude."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:208
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"EXAONE 3.5 is a collection of instruction-tuned bilingual (English and "
"Korean) generative models ranging from 2.4B to 32B parameters, developed and "
"released by LG AI Research."
msgstr ""
"EXAONE 3.5 ingelesezko eta koreerazko eredu sortzaile elebidunen bilduma bat "
"da, jarraibideetara doitua, 2,4B eta 32B parametro bitartekoa, eta LG AI "
"Researchek garatu eta argitaratua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:210
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Sailor2 are multilingual language models made for South-East Asia. Available "
"in 1B, 8B, and 20B parameter sizes."
msgstr ""
"Sailor2 Asiako hego-ekialderako egindako hizkuntza-eredu eleaniztunak dira. "
"1B, 8B eta 20B parametroko tamainetan daude eskuragarri."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:212
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A family of efficient AI models under 10B parameters performant in science, "
"math, and coding through innovative training techniques."
msgstr ""
"10B parametro baino gutxiagoko AA eredu eraginkorren familia, trebakuntza-"
"teknika berritzaileen bidez zientzian, matematikan eta kodegintzan "
"errendimendu ona duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:214
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The IBM Granite 2B and 8B models are text-only dense LLMs trained on over 12 "
"trillion tokens of data, demonstrated significant improvements over their "
"predecessors in performance and speed in IBM’s initial testing."
msgstr ""
"IBM Granite 2B eta 8B ereduak testu hutseko LLM trinkoak dira, 12 bilioi "
"datu-token baino gehiagorekin trebatuak; IBMren hasierako probetan aurreko "
"ereduekiko errendimendu- eta abiadura-hobekuntza nabarmenak erakutsi dituzte."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:217
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The IBM Granite 1B and 3B models are long-context mixture of experts (MoE) "
"Granite models from IBM designed for low latency usage."
msgstr ""
"IBM Granite 1B eta 3B ereduak IBMren testuinguru luzeko adituen nahasketako "
"(MoE) Granite ereduak dira, latentzia txikiko erabilerarako diseinatuak."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:219
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The IBM Granite Embedding 30M and 278M models models are text-only dense "
"biencoder embedding models, with 30M available in English only and 278M "
"serving multilingual use cases."
msgstr ""
"IBM Granite Embedding 30M eta 278M ereduak testu hutseko bi kodetzaileko "
"txertatze-eredu trinkoak dira; 30M ingelesez soilik dago eskuragarri, eta "
"278M ereduak hizkuntza anitzeko erabilera-kasuak zerbitzatzen ditu."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:221
#, kde-format
msgid "Phi-4 is a 14B parameter, state-of-the-art open model from Microsoft."
msgstr ""
"Phi-4 Microsoften puntako teknologiako 14B parametroko eredu ireki bat da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:222
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A new small reasoning model fine-tuned from the Qwen 2.5 3B Instruct model."
msgstr ""
"Qwen 2.5 3B Instruct eredutik doitutako arrazoiketa-eredu txiki berria."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:224
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Dolphin 3.0 Llama 3.1 8B 🐬 is the next generation of the Dolphin series of "
"instruct-tuned models designed to be the ultimate general purpose local "
"model, enabling coding, math, agentic, function calling, and general use "
"cases."
msgstr ""
"Dolphin 3.0 Llama 3.1 8B 🐬 Dolphin sailaren jarraibideetara doitutako "
"ereduen hurrengo belaunaldia da; erabilera orokorreko tokiko behin betiko "
"eredua izateko diseinatu da, kodegintza, matematika, agente bidezko lana, "
"funtzio-deiak eta erabilera orokorrak ahalbidetuz."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:227
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"DeepSeek's first-generation of reasoning models with comparable performance "
"to OpenAI-o1, including six dense models distilled from DeepSeek-R1 based on "
"Llama and Qwen."
msgstr ""
"DeepSeeken lehen belaunaldiko arrazoiketa-ereduak, OpenAI-o1en pareko "
"errendimendua dutenak; horien artean daude DeepSeek-R1etik destilatutako eta "
"Llaman nahiz Qwenen oinarritutako sei eredu trinko."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:229
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A strong Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) language model with 671B total parameters "
"with 37B activated for each token."
msgstr ""
"Adituen nahasketako (MoE) hizkuntza-eredu sendoa, guztira 671B parametro "
"dituena eta token bakoitzeko 37B aktibatzen dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:231
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"OLMo 2 is a new family of 7B and 13B models trained on up to 5T tokens. "
"These models are on par with or better than equivalently sized fully open "
"models, and competitive with open-weight models such as Llama 3.1 on English "
"academic benchmarks."
msgstr ""
"OLMo 2 7B eta 13Bko ereduen familia berria da, gehienez 5 bilioi tokenekin "
"trebatua. Tamaina bereko eredu guztiz irekien parekoak edo hobeak dira, eta "
"ingelesezko erreferentzia-proba akademikoetan Llama 3.1 gisako pisu irekiko "
"ereduen lehiakide dira."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:234
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The smallest model in Cohere's R series delivers top-tier speed, efficiency, "
"and quality to build powerful AI applications on commodity GPUs and edge "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"Cohereren R saileko eredu txikienak goi-mailako abiadura, eraginkortasuna "
"eta kalitatea eskaintzen ditu, ohiko GPUetan eta gailu periferikoetan AA "
"aplikazio ahaltsuak eraikitzeko."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:236
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A fully open-source family of reasoning models built using a dataset derived "
"by distilling DeepSeek-R1."
msgstr ""
"DeepSeek-R1 destilatuz eratorritako datu-multzo batekin eraikitako sorburu "
"guztiz irekiko arrazoiketa-ereduen familia."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:238
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A fine-tuned version of Deepseek-R1-Distilled-Qwen-1.5B that surpasses the "
"performance of OpenAI’s o1-preview with just 1.5B parameters on popular math "
"evaluations."
msgstr ""
"Deepseek-R1-Distilled-Qwen-1.5B ereduaren bertsio doitua, 1,5B "
"parametrorekin soilik matematikako ebaluazio ezagunetan OpenAIren o1-preview "
"ereduaren errendimendua gainditzen duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:241
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A version of the DeepSeek-R1 model that has been post trained to provide "
"unbiased, accurate, and factual information by Perplexity."
msgstr ""
"Perplexityk informazio alboragabea, zehatza eta egitateetan oinarritua "
"emateko osteko trebakuntza egin dion DeepSeek-R1 ereduaren bertsioa."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:242
#, kde-format
msgid "The current, most capable model that runs on a single GPU."
msgstr "GPU bakarrean exekutatzen den egungo eredurik gaitasun handienekoa."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:244
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Phi-4-mini brings significant enhancements in multilingual support, "
"reasoning, and mathematics, and now, the long-awaited function calling "
"feature is finally supported."
msgstr ""
"Phi-4-minik hobekuntza nabarmenak dakartza hizkuntza anitzeko euskarrian, "
"arrazoiketan eta matematikan; gainera, luzaroan espero izandako funtzio-"
"deien eginbidea onartzen du orain."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:247
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A compact and efficient vision-language model, specifically designed for "
"visual document understanding, enabling automated content extraction from "
"tables, charts, infographics, plots, diagrams, and more."
msgstr ""
"Ikusmen- eta hizkuntza-eredu trinko eta eraginkorra, ikusizko dokumentuak "
"ulertzeko berariaz diseinatua; tauletatik, grafikoetatik, infografietatik, "
"diagrametatik eta abarretatik edukia automatikoki erauztea ahalbidetzen du."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:249
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Granite-3.2 is a family of long-context AI models from IBM Granite fine-"
"tuned for thinking capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Granite-3.2 IBM Graniteren testuinguru luzeko AA ereduen familia da, "
"arrazoiketa-gaitasunetarako doitua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:251
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A new state-of-the-art version of the lightweight Command R7B model that "
"excels in advanced Arabic language capabilities for enterprises in the "
"Middle East and Northern Africa."
msgstr ""
"Command R7B eredu arinaren puntako teknologiako bertsio berria, Ekialde "
"Hurbileko eta Ipar Afrikako enpresetarako arabierazko gaitasun aurreratuetan "
"bikain aritzen dena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:253
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"111 billion parameter model optimized for demanding enterprises that require "
"fast, secure, and high-quality AI"
msgstr ""
"111 mila milioi parametroko eredua, AA azkarra, segurua eta kalitate "
"handikoa behar duten enpresa zorrotzetarako optimizatua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:255
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"EXAONE Deep exhibits superior capabilities in various reasoning tasks "
"including math and coding benchmarks, ranging from 2.4B to 32B parameters "
"developed and released by LG AI Research."
msgstr ""
"EXAONE Deepek gaitasun bikainak ditu hainbat arrazoiketa-atazatan, "
"matematika- eta kodegintza-erreferentzia-probak barne; LG AI Researchek "
"garatu eta argitaratutako 2,4B eta 32B parametro bitarteko ereduak dira."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:258
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Building upon Mistral Small 3, Mistral Small 3.1 (2503) adds state-of-the-"
"art vision understanding and enhances long context capabilities up to 128k "
"tokens without compromising text performance."
msgstr ""
"Mistral Small 3n oinarrituta, Mistral Small 3.1 (2503) ereduak puntako "
"ikusmen-ulermena gehitzen du eta testuinguru luzeko gaitasunak 128K token "
"arte hobetzen ditu, testuaren errendimendua kaltetu gabe."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:261
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Cogito v1 Preview is a family of hybrid reasoning models by Deep Cogito that "
"outperform the best available open models of the same size, including "
"counterparts from LLaMA, DeepSeek, and Qwen across most standard benchmarks."
msgstr ""
"Cogito v1 Preview Deep Cogitoren arrazoiketa-eredu hibridoen familia da; "
"erreferentzia-proba estandar gehienetan tamaina bereko eredu ireki "
"erabilgarri onenak gainditzen ditu, LLaMAren, DeepSeeken eta Qwenen "
"baliokideak barne."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:263
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"DeepCoder is a fully open-Source 14B coder model at O3-mini level, with a "
"1.5B version also available."
msgstr ""
"DeepCoder sorburu guztiz irekiko 14Bko kode-eredua da, O3-mini mailakoa; "
"1,5Bko bertsioa ere eskuragarri dago."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:265
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Qwen3 is the latest generation of large language models in Qwen series, "
"offering a comprehensive suite of dense and mixture-of-experts (MoE) models."
msgstr ""
"Qwen3 Qwen saileko hizkuntza-eredu handien azken belaunaldia da, eredu "
"trinkoen eta adituen nahasketako (MoE) ereduen multzo osoa eskaintzen duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:267
#, kde-format
msgid "Meta's latest collection of multimodal models."
msgstr "Metaren eredu multimodalen azken bilduma."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:269
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"IBM Granite 2B and 8B models are 128K context length language models that "
"have been fine-tuned for improved reasoning and instruction-following "
"capabilities."
msgstr ""
"IBM Granite 2B eta 8B ereduak 128K-ko testuinguru-luzera duten hizkuntza-"
"ereduak dira, arrazoiketa eta jarraibideak betetzeko gaitasunak hobetzeko "
"doituak."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:272
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Phi 4 reasoning and reasoning plus are 14-billion parameter open-weight "
"reasoning models that rival much larger models on complex reasoning tasks."
msgstr ""
"Phi 4 reasoning eta reasoning plus 14 mila milioi parametroko pisu irekiko "
"arrazoiketa-ereduak dira, arrazoiketa-ataza konplexuetan askoz eredu "
"handiagoen parekoak."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:274
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Phi 4 mini reasoning is a lightweight open model that balances efficiency "
"with advanced reasoning ability."
msgstr ""
"Phi 4 mini reasoning eredu ireki arina da, eraginkortasuna eta arrazoiketa-"
"gaitasun aurreratua orekatzen dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:275
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Gemma 3n models are designed for efficient execution on everyday devices "
"such as laptops, tablets or phones."
msgstr ""
"Gemma 3n ereduak ordenagailu eramangarrietan, tabletetan eta telefonoetan "
"eraginkortasunez exekutatzeko diseinatuta daude."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:276
#, kde-format
msgid "Magistral is a small, efficient reasoning model with 24B parameters."
msgstr "Magistral 24B parametroko arrazoiketa-eredu txiki eta eraginkorra da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:277
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"An update to Mistral Small that improves on function calling, instruction "
"following, and less repetition errors."
msgstr ""
"Mistral Smallen eguneraketa bat, funtzio-deiak eta jarraibideak betetzea "
"hobetzen dituena eta errepikapen-akats gutxiago egiten dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:278
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Flagship vision-language model of Qwen and also a significant leap from the "
"previous Qwen2-VL."
msgstr ""
"Qwenen ikusmen- eta hizkuntza-eredu enblematikoa, eta aurreko Qwen2-VLrekiko "
"jauzi nabarmena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:279
#, kde-format
msgid "Devstral: the best open source model for coding agents."
msgstr "Devstral: kodegintza-agenteetarako sorburu irekiko eredurik onena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:280
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"OpenAI’s open-weight models designed for powerful reasoning, agentic tasks, "
"and versatile developer use cases."
msgstr ""
"OpenAIren pisu irekiko ereduak, arrazoiketa ahaltsurako, agente bidezko "
"atazetarako eta garatzaileen erabilera-kasu moldakorretarako diseinatuak."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:281
#, kde-format
msgid "Alibaba's performant long context models for agentic and coding tasks."
msgstr ""
"Alibabaren testuinguru luzeko errendimendu handiko ereduak, agente bidezko "
"eta kodegintzako atazetarako."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:282
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"DeepSeek-V3.1 is a hybrid model that supports both thinking mode and non-"
"thinking mode."
msgstr ""
"DeepSeek-V3.1 eredu hibridoa da, arrazoiketa-modua eta arrazoiketarik gabeko "
"modua onartzen dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:283
#, kde-format
msgid "EmbeddingGemma is a 300M parameter embedding model from Google."
msgstr "EmbeddingGemma Googleren 300M parametroko txertatze-eredua da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:285
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"EmBuilding upon the foundational models of the Qwen3 series, Qwen3 Embedding "
"provides a comprehensive range of text embeddings models in various sizes."
msgstr ""
"Qwen3 saileko oinarrizko ereduetatik abiatuta, Qwen3 Embeddingek hainbat "
"tamainatako testu-txertatze ereduen sorta osoa eskaintzen du."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:288
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Granite 4 features improved instruction following (IF) and tool-calling "
"capabilities, making them more effective in enterprise applications."
msgstr ""
"Granite 4k jarraibideak betetzeko (IF) eta tresna-deietarako gaitasun hobeak "
"ditu, eta horri esker eraginkorragoa da enpresa-aplikazioetan."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:289
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The most powerful vision-language model in the Qwen model family to date."
msgstr ""
"Orain arteko Qwen eredu-familiako ikusmen- eta hizkuntza-eredurik ahaltsuena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:290
#, kde-format
msgid "Advanced agentic, reasoning and coding capabilities.."
msgstr "Agente bidezko, arrazoiketako eta kodegintzako gaitasun aurreratuak."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:292
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art mixture-of-experts (MoE) language model. Kimi K2-"
"Instruct-0905 demonstrates significant improvements in performance on public "
"benchmarks and real-world coding agent tasks."
msgstr ""
"Adituen nahasketako (MoE) puntako hizkuntza-eredua. Kimi K2-Instruct-0905ek "
"errendimendu-hobekuntza nabarmenak erakusten ditu erreferentzia-proba "
"publikoetan eta mundu errealeko kodegintza-agenteen atazetan."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:294
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"MiniMax M2 is a high-efficiency large language model built for coding and "
"agentic workflows."
msgstr ""
"MiniMax M2 kodegintzarako eta agente bidezko lan-fluxuetarako eraikitako "
"eraginkortasun handiko hizkuntza-eredu handia da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:295
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"DeepSeek-OCR is a vision-language model that can perform token-efficient OCR."
msgstr ""
"DeepSeek-OCR tokenak eraginkortasunez erabiltzen dituen OCRa egin dezakeen "
"ikusmen- eta hizkuntza-eredua da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:296
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"gpt-oss-safeguard-20b and gpt-oss-safeguard-120b are safety reasoning models "
"built-upon gpt-oss."
msgstr ""
"gpt-oss-safeguard-20b eta gpt-oss-safeguard-120b gpt-ossen gainean "
"eraikitako segurtasuneko arrazoiketa-ereduak dira."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:298
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Google's most intelligent model with SOTA reasoning and multimodal "
"understanding, and powerful agentic and vibe coding capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Googleren eredurik adimentsuena, puntako arrazoiketa eta ulermen "
"multimodala, eta agente bidezko nahiz «vibe coding» kodegintzako gaitasun "
"ahaltsuak dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:299
#, kde-format
msgid "Kimi K2 Thinking, Moonshot AI's best open-source thinking model."
msgstr ""
"Kimi K2 Thinking, Moonshot AIren sorburu irekiko arrazoiketa-eredurik onena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:300
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The Cogito v2.1 LLMs are instruction tuned generative models. All models are "
"released under MIT license for commercial use."
msgstr ""
"Cogito v2.1 LLMak jarraibideetara doitutako eredu sortzaileak dira. Eredu "
"guztiak MIT lizentziarekin argitaratzen dira merkataritza-erabilerarako."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:301
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The Ministral 3 family is designed for edge deployment, capable of running "
"on a wide range of hardware."
msgstr ""
"Ministral 3 familia gailu periferikoetan hedatzeko diseinatuta dago, eta "
"hardware mota askotan exekuta daiteke."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:303
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Rnj-1 is a family of 8B parameter open-weight, dense models trained from "
"scratch by Essential AI, optimized for code and STEM with capabilities on "
"par with SOTA open-weight models."
msgstr ""
"Rnj-1 Essential AIk hutsetik trebatutako 8B parametroko pisu irekiko eredu "
"trinkoen familia da; kodegintzarako eta STEM arloetarako optimizatuta dago, "
"eta puntako pisu irekiko ereduen pareko gaitasunak ditu."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:306
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The first installment in the Qwen3-Next series with strong performance in "
"terms of both parameter efficiency and inference speed."
msgstr ""
"Qwen3-Next saileko lehen eredua, parametroen eraginkortasunean eta "
"inferentzia-abiaduran errendimendu sendoa duena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:307
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Nemotron 3 Nano - A new Standard for Efficient, Open, and Intelligent "
"Agentic Models."
msgstr ""
"Nemotron 3 Nano: agente bidezko eredu eraginkor, ireki eta adimentsuetarako "
"estandar berria."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:309
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"24B model that excels at using tools to explore codebases, editing multiple "
"files and power software engineering agents."
msgstr ""
"24Bko eredua, tresnak erabiliz kode-oinarriak aztertzen, hainbat fitxategi "
"editatzen eta software-ingeniaritzako agenteak bultzatzen bikain aritzen "
"dena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:311
#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:318
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Olmo is a series of Open language models designed to enable the science of "
"language models. These models are pre-trained on the Dolma 3 dataset and "
"post-trained on the Dolci datasets."
msgstr ""
"Olmo hizkuntza-ereduen zientzia ahalbidetzeko diseinatutako hizkuntza-eredu "
"irekien saila da. Eredu horiek Dolma 3 datu-multzoarekin aurretik trebatu "
"eta Dolci datu-multzoekin ondoren trebatu dira."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:313
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A new collection of open translation models built on Gemma 3, helping people "
"communicate across 55 languages."
msgstr ""
"Gemma 3n oinarritutako itzulpen-eredu irekien bilduma berria, pertsonei 55 "
"hizkuntzatan komunikatzen laguntzen diena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:315
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"As the strongest model in the 30B class, GLM-4.7-Flash offers a new option "
"for lightweight deployment that balances performance and efficiency."
msgstr ""
"30B mailako eredurik sendoena denez, GLM-4.7-Flash ereduak errendimendua eta "
"eraginkortasuna orekatzen dituen hedapen arinerako aukera berria eskaintzen "
"du."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:320
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"123B model that excels at using tools to explore codebases, editing multiple "
"files and power software engineering agents."
msgstr ""
"123Bko eredua, tresnak erabiliz kode-oinarriak aztertzen, hainbat fitxategi "
"editatzen eta software-ingeniaritzako agenteak bultzatzen bikain aritzen "
"dena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:321
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"FunctionGemma is a specialized version of Google's Gemma 3 270M model fine-"
"tuned explicitly for function calling."
msgstr ""
"FunctionGemma Googleren Gemma 3 270M ereduaren bertsio espezializatua da, "
"funtzio-deietarako berariaz doitua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:322
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Gemini 3 Flash offers frontier intelligence built for speed at a fraction of "
"the cost."
msgstr ""
"Gemini 3 Flashek puntako adimena eskaintzen du, abiadurarako eraikia eta "
"kostuaren zati baten truke."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:323
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"nomic-embed-text-v2-moe is a multilingual MoE text embedding model that "
"excels at multilingual retrieval."
msgstr ""
"nomic-embed-text-v2-moe adituen nahasketako (MoE) testu-txertatze eredu "
"eleaniztuna da, hizkuntza anitzeko berreskuratzean bikain aritzen dena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:324
#, kde-format
msgid "Advancing the Coding Capability"
msgstr "Kodegintza-gaitasuna aurreratzea."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:325
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"DeepSeek-V3.2, a model that harmonizes high computational efficiency with "
"superior reasoning and agent performance."
msgstr ""
"DeepSeek-V3.2k konputazio-eraginkortasun handia eta arrazoiketan nahiz "
"agenteen jardunean errendimendu bikaina bateratzen ditu."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:326
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A general-purpose multimodal mixture-of-experts model for production-grade "
"tasks and enterprise workloads."
msgstr ""
"Ekoizpen-mailako atazetarako eta enpresa-lanetarako erabilera orokorreko "
"adituen nahasketako eredu multimodala."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:327
#, kde-format
msgid "Exceptional multilingual capabilities to elevate code engineering"
msgstr "Kode-ingeniaritza goratzeko hizkuntza anitzeko gaitasun bikainak."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:328
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"LFM2.5 is a new family of hybrid models designed for on-device deployment."
msgstr ""
"LFM2.5 gailuan bertan hedatzeko diseinatutako eredu hibridoen familia berria "
"da."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:330
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Kimi K2.5 is an open-source, native multimodal agentic model that seamlessly "
"integrates vision and language understanding with advanced agentic "
"capabilities, instant and thinking modes, as well as conversational and "
"agentic paradigms."
msgstr ""
"Kimi K2.5 sorburu irekiko berezko eredu multimodal eta agente bidezkoa da; "
"ikusmenaren eta hizkuntzaren ulermena agente-gaitasun aurreratuekin, "
"berehalako eta arrazoiketa moduekin, eta elkarrizketa- nahiz agente-"
"paradigmekin bateratzen ditu."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:333
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A strong reasoning and agentic model from Z.ai with 744B total parameters "
"(40B active), built for complex systems engineering and long-horizon tasks."
msgstr ""
"Z.airen arrazoiketa-eredu agentiko sendoa, guztira 744B parametro dituena "
"(40B aktibo); sistema-ingeniaritza konplexurako eta epe luzeko atazetarako "
"eraikia."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:335
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"MiniMax-M2.5 is a state-of-the-art large language model designed for real-"
"world productivity and coding tasks."
msgstr ""
"MiniMax-M2.5 puntako hizkuntza-eredu handia da, mundu errealeko "
"produktibitaterako eta kodegintza-atazetarako diseinatua."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:337
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Gemma 4 models are designed to deliver frontier-level performance at each "
"size. They are well-suited for reasoning, agentic workflows, coding, and "
"multimodal understanding."
msgstr ""
"Gemma 4 ereduak tamaina bakoitzean puntako errendimendua emateko diseinatuta "
"daude. Egokiak dira arrazoiketarako, agente bidezko lan-fluxuetarako, "
"kodegintzarako eta ulermen multimodalerako."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:339
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Qwen 3.5 is a family of open-source multimodal models that delivers "
"exceptional utility and performance."
msgstr ""
"Qwen 3.5 sorburu irekiko eredu multimodalen familia da, erabilgarritasun eta "
"errendimendu bikainak eskaintzen dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:341
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"LFM2 is a family of hybrid models designed for on-device deployment. "
"LFM2-24B-A2B is the largest model in the family, scaling the architecture to "
"24 billion parameters while keeping inference efficient."
msgstr ""
"LFM2 gailuan bertan hedatzeko diseinatutako eredu hibridoen familia da. "
"LFM2-24B-A2B familiako eredurik handiena da; arkitektura 24 mila milioi "
"parametrora eskalatzen du, inferentziaren eraginkortasuna mantenduz."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:344
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Super is a 120B open MoE model activating just 12B "
"parameters to deliver maximum compute efficiency and accuracy for complex "
"multi-agent applications."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Super 120Bko MoE eredu irekia da, 12B parametro soilik "
"aktibatzen dituena, agente anitzeko aplikazio konplexuetan konputazio-"
"eraginkortasun eta zehaztasun handienak eskaintzeko."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:347
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"An open 30B MoE model from NVIDIA with 3B activated parameters that delivers "
"strong reasoning and agentic capabilities."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIAren 30Bko MoE eredu irekia, 3B parametro aktibatzen dituena eta "
"arrazoiketa- nahiz agente-gaitasun sendoak eskaintzen dituena."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:348
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"MiniMax's M2-series model for coding, agentic workflows, and professional "
"productivity."
msgstr ""
"MiniMaxen M2 saileko eredua, kodegintzarako, agente bidezko lan-fluxuetarako "
"eta lanbide-produktibitaterako."

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonmodelutils.cpp:349
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Qwen3.6 delivers substantial upgrades in agentic coding and thinking "
"preservation than previous Qwen models."
msgstr ""
"Qwen3.6k aurreko Qwen ereduek baino hobekuntza nabarmenak eskaintzen ditu "
"agente bidezko kodegintzan eta arrazoiketa mantentzen."

